#: bulkhandler.i18n.php:8
msgid ""
"Bulk Handler manages the bulk export or import of extensions, DIDs, user "
"manager users, user manager groups, and contacts. You can export any of "
"these as a CSV file. You can also upload a CSV file to save time versus "
"having to enter each item individually. The module provides required/"
"recommended headers for your CSV files."
msgstr ""
"大量處理器可管理分機、DID、使用者管理員的使用者、使用者管理員的群組與聯絡人的大量匯出或匯入。您可以將其中任何項目匯出為 CSV 檔案。您也可以上傳 CSV 檔案，省去逐一輸入每個項目的時間。此模組提供您 CSV 檔案所需的必要/建議標頭。"

